{"id":"663630","name":"腌笃鲜","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/663630/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"250g"},{"name":"咸肉","amount":"100g"},{"name":"春笋","amount":"500g"},{"name":"干豆腐","amount":"3张"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"1颗"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1块"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材，咸肉切块，春笋去皮。","img":"images/663630/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"凉水下锅，排骨和咸肉块焯水去沫。","img":"images/663630/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"春笋去皮，去根儿。","img":"images/663630/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"笋切滚刀块，热水焯水3分钟，加盐，去除草酸。","img":"images/663630/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"排骨和咸肉焯水以后，清洗干净。","img":"images/663630/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"热锅大油。","img":"images/663630/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炒姜片，煸炒排骨和咸肉，炒上色。","img":"images/663630/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入开水。","img":"images/663630/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入笋块，葱结。","img":"images/663630/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入砂锅，加入干豆腐结，小火炖1个小时。","img":"images/663630/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"太鲜美了。","img":"images/663630/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}